{"id":"6a35041718","t":"Survivalism","c":"cv","n":21,"l":21,"s":["mg","ml"],"k":{"mg":"survivalism","ml":"survivalism"},"u":1795814250603,"desc":"عندما تنتقل حافلة تقل طلاباً بعد انتهاء اليوم الدراسي إلى عالم آخر محفوف بالمخاطر ويعج بالوحوش، سرعان ما يسيطر اليأس والذعر على الجميع. ولكن، يلوح بصيص من الأمل من وسط هذا الجحيم عندما يبدأ تطبيق الذكاء الاصطناعي الخاص بالبطل وحده في العمل، ليصبح بمثابة طوق النجاة الوحيد والأمل الأخير من أجل البقاء (حصريا علي موقع لافا سكانز). اقرأ مانهوا Survivalism مترجمة بالكامل بأعلى جودة على مانجا تايم (MangaTime). تابع أحدث الفصول الحصرية فور نزولها على موقعنا.","type":"مانهوا","status":"مستمر","genres":["أكشن","دراما","فانتازيا","إثارة"],"src":{"mg":"survivalism","ml":"survivalism"},"chapters":{"1":{"mg":"survivalism|","ml":"survivalism|/manga/survivalism/1/"},"2":{"mg":"survivalism|","ml":"survivalism|/manga/survivalism/2/"},"3":{"mg":"survivalism|","ml":"survivalism|/manga/survivalism/3/"},"4":{"mg":"survivalism|","ml":"survivalism|/manga/survivalism/4/"},"5":{"mg":"survivalism|","ml":"survivalism|/manga/survivalism/5/"},"6":{"mg":"survivalism|","ml":"survivalism|/manga/survivalism/6/"},"7":{"mg":"survivalism|","ml":"survivalism|/manga/survivalism/7/"},"8":{"mg":"survivalism|","ml":"survivalism|/manga/survivalism/8/"},"9":{"mg":"survivalism|","ml":"survivalism|/manga/survivalism/9/"},"10":{"mg":"survivalism|","ml":"survivalism|/manga/survivalism/10/"},"11":{"mg":"survivalism|","ml":"survivalism|/manga/survivalism/11/"},"12":{"mg":"survivalism|","ml":"survivalism|/manga/survivalism/12/"},"13":{"mg":"survivalism|","ml":"survivalism|/manga/survivalism/13/"},"14":{"mg":"survivalism|","ml":"survivalism|/manga/survivalism/14/"},"15":{"mg":"survivalism|","ml":"survivalism|/manga/survivalism/15/"},"16":{"mg":"survivalism|","ml":"survivalism|/manga/survivalism/16/"},"17":{"mg":"survivalism|","ml":"survivalism|/manga/survivalism/17/"},"18":{"mg":"survivalism|","ml":"survivalism|/manga/survivalism/18/"},"19":{"mg":"survivalism|","ml":"surviv